      { "sa": "teṣu", "en": "in them" },
      { "sa": "avasthitaḥ", "en": "standing" }
    ],
    "translation": "All this world is pervaded by me, the one of unmanifest form. All beings stand in me, and I do not stand in them."
  },
  "5": {
    "words": [
